{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/tytul.png?t=1745706253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Hidden Evidence</strong>, you play as one of four investigators hired to uncover proof of the government hiding critical information. You must work together\u2026 but not everyone is on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperative Gameplay \u2013 Team up to uncover the truth\u2026 but beware \u2013 one of you is a traitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/findsecurerun.gif?t=1745706253\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Secure the Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search the area and collect proof of the government\u2019s secret operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/oneofyouisatraitor.gif?t=1745706253\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Watch the Traitor</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The traitor has their own goals and will do whatever it takes to sabotage your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/staysilentstayalive.gif?t=1745706253\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your voice is your tool \u2014 or your risk. Sometimes, silence can save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who can you trust when every word and move could be your last?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3385610?t=1745706253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai